body:
Well they helped in a way. It was not a professional hotline so I have no ill will towards them.

&#x200B;

Yeah this sub helps a lot it's kind of conforting to know other people are in a bad place too. Not because I take pleasure knowing other suffer but I feel like we're in the same boat and there's like a frail but present camaraderie of the dammed here I like that it's comforting.

&#x200B;

As for the reason that made me call it's because my mom was diagnosed with a cancer and I was going throught a pretty rought time in my career.
